{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning was chess, and chess was good. Then chess got too good, and thus chess became less good. But then chess got Hexagon, and harmony ensued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pretty polished lean implementation of W\u0142adys\u0142aw Gli\u0144ski's Hexagonal Chess. The game itself is pretty old (~75 years) and got lost to time with its creator's death. It's worth another life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's similar to usual chess we all know &amp; love, but it uses hexes instead of default square grid. That changes the whole meta, invalidating tons of pre-existing memorized plays &amp; allowing for actually experiencing the game anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hotseat (local multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer with matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple beautiful maps to play on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive game chat</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220260?t=1767964951","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220260?t=1767964951","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220260/4e48291404fc87108ff22b656b74a91ac09ab940/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767964951","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220260/4e48291404fc87108ff22b656b74a91ac09ab940/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767964951","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4068960,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the beginning was chess, and chess was good. Then chess got too good, and thus chess became less good. But then chess got Hexagon, and harmony ensued.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a pretty polished lean implementation of W\u0142adys\u0142aw Gli\u0144ski's Hexagonal Chess. The game itself is pretty old (~75 years) and got lost to time with its creator's death. It's worth another life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's similar to usual chess we all know &amp; love, but it uses hexes instead of default square grid. That changes the whole meta, invalidating tons of pre-existing memorized plays &amp; allowing for actually experiencing the game anew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hotseat (local multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing against AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online multiplayer with matchmaking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple beautiful maps to play on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive game chat</p></li></ul>","developers":["Tricky Chaos"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220260/11b3caea0fb3bf07438da5da2e4fb1ab05e8d33d/header.jpg?t=1767964951","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3220260/1647085546/1775e87b41430b9c231bd8b281613e55416edd25/1763897763/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763898734","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3220260/1647085546/1775e87b41430b9c231bd8b281613e55416edd25/1763897763/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763898734","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steam